<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Ruuti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruutikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruutikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rut.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ruutikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Nage'i callinni wo'me'eek Ruutixxi jirte afende'eek Hayyooletik maxaafa'ni kulendeexxe xaqaro callixxe yanna'nitemman; Mo'aabike boga'ni ilendee. Ruutinna Isra'eelike manjo'ni heerundeen. Iikki heerundemmak manjichchi reyee wodda ballo isexxe No'aami'a lumoshsha xuurameettete kadde. Iittan kinni Isra'eelika Gootta Mageno lumoshsha mitte godobinni eetteen. Udumii'ni siretike aro'ike fira'ni heerunde. Konne heerumixxe daafe'n Isira'eelike lumoke moyanjo Daawwiti'a obobote kadde. Yessuusi Kirstoosi kinni Daawwitixxe sannen.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hayyoletik maxaafi haaso'a'neexxi jirtuwwa Mageniink ardi Magenokenaa'n bayyatemmaxxee iso'n gelteexxa ba'ne leellishshaan. Ruutiki maxaafi haaso'a'neexxi jirte kinni Mageno egendebaaxxi Manjichcho Isira'eelika Gootta Mageno amande alfiteexxa eebbanna Mageno addateeke manninni welti mitteba laakko'endeexxa laakko'ensha leellishshaan. Iittanni kinni Ruutik maxaafi kunni yowwendeexxi gosa Mageno adde assexxe'e Mageniinba daggoole Mageni gibebaang adhdhaake kadeexxa leellishsha maxaafan.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Na'oomixxa Ruutinni Welti Beeteliheemi'a Higa <char style="ior"><ref loc="RUT 1:1-22">1:1-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ruutixxanna Bo'eezixxa Afeshsha <char style="ior"><ref loc="RUT 2:1-3:18">2:1—3:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Bo'eezi Ruutii Aadhe <char style="ior"><ref loc="RUT 4:1-22">4:1-22</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ebemeelekinna Isik Minihadi Mo'aabik Bogiba Godaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Isira'eelike boga'n akeekisano galchitammake baro'n solo'i e'ye; tennenaa'n kexxeexxe'n Yihudake bogixxe galcha'ni Beetelihemike qachcha'ni mitti manjichchi are isixxinninna lame labbaxxe ifixxe oosenni hedho'a Mo'aabike boga'n me'e. Ebemelekite hiyyemaak Efratixxe gosake minik manji hedhemmani. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Isik summinna Ebemelek, aretik summi Na'oomi isixxe lame labbaxxe oosenna Mahilooninna Kelewooni hiyyemaamman; isinna ilenshat Eefiraatike kadee Beetelihemike qachcha'ni hedha'nemmnan; isinna ifike mini hadinni welti solo'inxi yanna saxxaa qico'n Mo'aabike bogibaa'n me'e offo'le. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Ebemelek reye; Na'oominna lame labbaxxe oose isexxe callinni gatte. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Oose issexxinna Mo'aabike bogika dubarra Orfa hinaaxxanna Ruuti hiyyendaaxxa aaxxe. Insa'nenna aa'ne tomme wogga turreechchinni uduma, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Mahilooninna Kelewooni lamiing renne. Na'oomi aro'o isekanna lamiinxa oose isexxa gophpheexxi qofinni gatte.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Na'oomi Ruutinni welti Beeteliheemi'a Higge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Na'oomi Mo'aabinge boga'n hexxe Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelike ardi'a marareexxi midha uwweexxa laqqe. Tennexxee iseke beltuwwixxe dubartenni Mo'aabike boganaa'n Isira'eelike bogibaa higgo'a kexxe. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Yihudake bogibaa me'atee'e isinni welti kexxe me'ite; yaane kinni orange'ni he'nee'na, <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Na'oomi «Yooni hado hanookibaa me'itine amuwwa ha'noonni welit hedhdhe; ani'aanna ha'nooke reyemmake aro'uwwi'a eloxxa assitinemmashshan iittanni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'no'aanna eloxxa assowwaal. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Higgeenna herundinaake mine'n elo qicinni galdine hossinaashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'no qarqaarowwaal» hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Ookkoneechchi uduma Na'oomi insa'nee nage'ik hedhdhe hita'n suunqexxe. Insa'nenna hiiqqinse oo'na'n, <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />«No'onna atinni welti gosa atixxiba'aa me'inanno malee'e ati birii'ni gantabo'non» hine.<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Na'oominna insa'nee «Anxe oose maganneten higge; aninni welti me'itino'a hassina'neek mayeete? Ha'no dhaaldaaxxa oose ila dande'aanechcho labba'nee? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Ha'nooke hadibaa me'e; ani wele labbalo'n heerumabo'noshsha cimeennen; heerumaannelchonna kaddeele telcho heerumennexxi labbaxxa oose ilennele, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />Insa'ne nophphine aadha genna qico'n ca'li hitine insa'nee heqqedha dandeetina? Tenne daafen wele labbalo'n heerundinebaang gattina? Anxe oosse haranga dandeessissabaaxxe kaddeexxa egendine'en; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'ni mufateen; matanga tenne ha'no'n gelteexxe rakko'a lumoshsha yaadannen!» Hite.<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Insa'nenna higgeenna hiiqqinse oo'ne; eettene yanna'n Orfa ballo isexxa Na'oomii sunqexxeexxi nage'ik hedhi hite hadi isekibaa me'ite. Ruuti kinni ballo isexxenaa'ni gargarit higabo'non hite mudhdhite. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Tennexxee Na'oomi «Ruuti! Atike hererechchixxi are Orfa gosa isexxibaanna dharichcha iseke magenuwwibaa'a higge'een; yoona atinna isenni welt higi» hite.<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Ruuti kinni «Atee waale higonna'a anee uttissoxxe'e. Ati me'itattoba duuchcha me'annon; ati hexxatoba hedhannon; telchinni edi'a atik Magen anke Magenon; atik ardi anke arda kadaan. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Ati rertatoba reyannon; ati mogeendattoba moogemannon; ateenna anee reyo malee'e gargarit hiissaachchi hedhebaan; atee waale me'onnaa'a hadanno baro Duuchchi Woddik Gootti tenne saxxeexxa rakko ane'n geesiso» hite.<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Na'oomi Ruuti isenni welti me'ito'a mudhdhiteexxa uuddeexxi wele lebbe haasotteechchi hedhebaan.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Tennexxe Na'oominna Ruuti Beeteliheemi'a me'ineexxi Beetelihemika qachcha gennee wodda qachchiink manni duuchchi insa'nee uude mambe'a hiyye; melaalletinna «Tinni dhugaandinni isi Na'oomindee?» hite.<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Na'oominna: «Dada duuchcha ajajaak Magen dande'ak hedho anxa qarartaaxxe assemmaxxee Maara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Maara: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya Ibrititotike laagadinni qaraaraachcho hiyyaten. </char></note> hiyye malee'e Na'oomi hitine ane yexxinoqqe'e. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Ani konne bogaanaa'ni fule me'enee wodda wo'ma angamman; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kinni duwwixxe anganni higannoshsha anee asseen; yoone dada duuchcha ajajaak Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti elobaaxxa yaane tenne idagaa woddanna rakko ane'ni geessissa wodda mayee Na'oomi hitine anee yexxina?» Hite.<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Tennexxe Na'oomi belti isekixxe arenni Mo'aabichcho Ruutinni welti Mo'aabike boganaa'n higge dagge; insa'nenna Beetelihemi genneek reef so'aa haammammaxxe mayetixxe yannanitemman.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ruuti Bo'eezike Fichchanaa'n Deegge Qocexxo'a Marte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Na'oomi aro'o isekee Ebemeleki'a aanteti shiqaaka Bo'eezite hinaaka dureessanna shiqika fira affeemman. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Mitte barra Mo'aabichcho Ruuti Na'oomii «Heqqi midha haamammake manjike fichchiba maro; dedha ani'a marare deegge qocedhi hiyyaaka manjo gophabo'noni» hite; Na'oominna «Marte qocexxaata anxe belto!» Hite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:9-10">Lew. 19:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:19">Lew. 24:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Tennexxe Ruutinna fichchuwwiinbaa marteexxi haamammake mannixxa duuka angatenaa'n ibbammaxxa deegge qocexxa'nemman; egendebaangi qocexxa'nemmaki fichchi kunni Ebemelek firike Bo'eezike fichchamman. <verse eid="RUT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Eettene yanna'n Bo'eezi Beeteliheemii'n ke'eexxi fichchiinba'a dage; haamammaka manna «Nage'inginni hossine! Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'noonni welti hedhowwaa!» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Insa'nenna «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee eebbiso'o!» Hine.<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Bo'eezi haamammake manni'a umoke kadeemmaka «Itti ka'untichcho belto ayyixxe?» Hiyye qore.<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Manjichchikinna «Ise Na'oominni welti Mo'aabike boganaa'ni daggeexxe Mo'aabichchon; <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Isenna haamammake manni udu'mii'ni me'ita'ni ibbemmaxxa deegge qocexxo'a anee laqqeen; gorsinaa'n ta'i qico'ni qocexxa'nemman; ta'a kinni shiixxo qico hafuura adhdhito'a fooqi giddo ofolde'een» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Eettene yanna'ni Bo'eezi Ruutii'i «Tee belto! Hiyyaanexa laqi; kaba haanda'neexxe melaallexxa duuka me'ita'ni qocedhi malee konne fichcha waalde wele fichchibaa me'itoxxee. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Melaalle hoone ga'manaa'n haanda'neexxa uudda'n insa'ne callinni hedhi. Kaba haama'neeki labballi atee rakkisabaashsha jabeesse kuleennen; wode'e dheebottotole odolchote'ni wonshine ugginemmaka marta'ni ibilsita'ni ha'wi» hiyye. <verse eid="RUT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Eettene yanna'ni Ruutinna albik buttinna tuqqa qico'n heeshshi hite, Bo'eezii «Konne qico ani'a hedde rakkattaateki mayeete? Wele bogixxe manjo kade ati edo ulfinna alifonaa hitta dande'eene?» Hite.<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Bo'eezinna «Aro'i atik reyeechchi uduma atixxe ballo'a assitettexxa eloxxa yaane duuchcha laqeenen; iittanni kinni anna atikanna ama atixxa, ilendetteka boga atika waalde konnechchi edi ga'ma egendeboxxoke ardinni welti hexxottaa daggetexxa ege'neennen. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Hujjetexxe eloxxe huje duuchchika hira Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati'aa uwwo. Qarqaarsa isika addateettexxi daggetaki Isira'eelik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni hira atik bira sa'aashsha atee eebbisowwaal» hiyyeexxi hiisse.<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Ruutinna «Anke gootta! Fedhee qiconna mine atike'ni hujammaxxe melaale giddii'ni mittetishsha uudama gophoo'nolna lumoshsha ani'a atixxe erganjo'a arjoondetexxi eloke atike haaso'inni anee dayyeesiteeten» hite.<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Dhiyaana indammaxxe yanna'n Bo'eez Ruutii «Amo qoreti biri'a shikki hite; kebbo adhdhitetexxi woxeeti bookkitta'ni iti» hiyye. Isenna midha haamammake mannini welti ofolde; Bo'eezinna anneeka deeddamo uwwe; isenna goddita qico'n itte; itattanna itte gophphee'naa gatteeman. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Ruutinna higgeenni qocexxo'a kexxee wodda Bo'eezi haamammaka manna, «Ladde hoyyendebaang oddo oddote'ninna saxxa'n qocexxuun hoyyitinoqqen; <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Matanga usurtineemmaxxe ladduwwanaa'n luqqisina'ni waaldinaa'naa qocexxuun» hiyye.<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Tennexxe Ruutinna qocexxa'n hossemmaxxa deegge uxxitee wodda lame gimbe kadde.<verse eid="RUT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Midha ba'exxe qachchi giddi'a higge; isenna hittee qicika qocceexxa ballo isexxee'e leellishshe. Ittanni barra itte gophphee'na gattemmaxxa itanna uute. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Na'oominna «Tenne midha duuchcha habaa'n qoccette? Qocca'ni hosseteki fichchi ayyike? Tenne eloxxa ati'a asseeka manjo Mageni iso eebbiso» hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Ruutinna «Ani qoca'ni hoseenneke fichchiik anni Bo'eezite hinaaken» hite ballote'n kulde.<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Na'oominna «Hedheekeenna reyeeke uwweexxa adde muuxaak dada duuchchik Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Bo'eezii eebbisowwaal!» Hite; higgeenna «Ikki manjichchiqqa no'o'a shiqixxe aante kademmaxxee no'oo gargaaraan hinannoke firanaa'ni mitteke» hite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:25">Lew. 25:25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mo'aabichcho Ruuti «Duuchchiinxe iimi gama anee mambe'a assiteexxi midha haamme bukki assina qico'n haamammake manni birii'n gattebo'nongi deegge qocedhannoshsha kuleexxen» hite.<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Na'oominna Ruutii'i «Anxe belto dhugaate hiteten! Bo'eezike fichcha'n hujjaammaxxe melaalluwwaxxa duuka me'ita'ni qocexxotole woyyan; wele manjike fichchibaa me'itetexxe kaddoole akimagaada ka'um atee rakkisaan» hite. <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Tennexxe Ruuti so'akanna dinne fichchakenaa'n haammende bukki hitaa qico'n Bo'eezixxe garbitte bira haandammaxxe melaallen welti me'ita'n deegge qocexxa'n turitteen; isenna ballo isexxe Na'oomi birii'ni gargariti higgebaang isenni mitteba hexxaamman.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Na'oomi Ruutii Bo'eezi'ni Shiqqaashsha Assite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Na'oomi Ruutii, «Bulte eloxxe'n fuldota'a eloka heerundatoka manjo hasennele woyyan. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Egendetteshshanni deegge qocca'n welti hossattaxxi melaalluwwa ergatenda'neek Bo'eezi fira no'okeeten; isinna dokko galgala so'a uxxa'neen, <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Tennexxe biso anshexxe, qayyexxe ifi seefati. Ookkoneechchi uduma isi so'aa uxxaammaxxee aldu'mebaa me'i; yaane kinni hirbaata ite ha'waa qico'n ille isixxe'ni leellitoxxe'e. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Isi haba diiphaaxxa hubatte uuddetechchi uduma isi diiphe cokokki hiyyamma wodda isi biri'a shikki hite seemma faashshetexxi lekkatibaa'ni dhiiphi; isinna maa assitattoxxa ate'ni kulaan» hite.<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Ruutinna «Hitetexxa duuchcha muuxxannon» hite.<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Tennexxe Ruuti aldu'metibaa marte ballo isexxi hitemmashshanni assiteen. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Bo'eezi ite ha'weechchi uduma ifi eeyye gophe so'iinxe tuulobaa me'eexxi irkatemmaba diiphe; Ruutinna laana isi biri'a shikki hiteexxi seemma isixxa faashshe lekkatibaa'n diiphe. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Bo'eezi hashsha wodhakka kadamaa wodda dammaqeexxi cinaachcha wirri hiyyaa wodda mitte manjichcho isixxe lekkaba diiphphee'naa afe mambe'a hiyye; <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />«Ati ayyete?» Hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Isenna «Anke gootta ante Ruutiten; ati shiqixxe aante kaddettaxxee duuchchiinxi uuddaak ateten; ane'ni seemma buyyisi» hite.<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Bo'eezinna «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee eebbiso anxe belto; ta'a assitaatexxe yaane iimi gama konnechchi edi gama ballo atixxee assitetexxi eloxxi yaane addatensha atixxa leellishaaxxen; Ati hasseetele duureessa yookaan hiyyeessa mitte ka'untichcho'n heerundattan; yaane kinni iitta assatee hasseboxxon; <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Yoona anxe belto mee yaadi! Ati hassetexxa duuchcha ani ati'a wonshannon; atinna eloxxe manjo kaddetexxa qachchi duuchchik manni ege'neen. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Ani shiqixxe aante atixxe kada dhugaaten; atixxi yaane duuchchanna uuddaak anten; yaane kinni ani iimi ga'ma aanteti shiqaak manji hedheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 2:20">Rut. 2:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Soodaa qico'ni kabanni diiphi; bogi soodee'naa ikki manjichchi ati'a hasissaaxxa wonshaakenna wonshabaake kadeexxa isoo qorrannon; isi isexxi yaane anee uuddaan hiyyoole eloxxen; isexxi yaane anee uuddabaan hiyyoole kinni ani ati'a hasissaaxxa wonshannoxxa hedhaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni kakataannen; soodaa qico'ni kabanni diiphi» hiyye.<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Tennexxe Ruuti Bo'eezixxe lekkamba diiphphe. Yaane kinni Bo'eezi Ruuti isinni welti hexxemmaxxa ayyinna ege'no'a hansa gopheemmaxxee, Ruuti ayyinna afebaang bariisa diiphii'n kexxe. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Bo'eezinna Ruutii'i «Fugatteettexxa bayyanni farri assedhi» hiyye. Isenna farri assexxe; Bo'eezinna jaane ginbe geyaaka so'a qulxube usure dudduroke'n ba'isse. Isenna qachchi giddi'a higge. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Ruutinna mini'a e'yitee wodda ballo isexxi Na'oomi «Anxe belto ikki haaso'i maa kade?» Hite. Ruutinna Bo'eezi ise'a asseexxa duuchcha haasotte. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Higgeen «Ballo atixxe'n anga duwwixxin martoxxen hiyyeexxi konne so'a duuchcha ani'a uwween» hite.<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Na'oominna «Yooni anxe belto! Tinni duuchcha muuxendaaxxee ossunteti heqqedhi; Bo'eezi tenne yaane telchonni bire baak haranga diiphabaan» hite.<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bo'eezi Ruutii Aadhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Bo'eezi qachchiinii qarqara hexxemmaxxe songoba mare ofo'le. Ookko'ni Bo'eezi Ruuti'ni kulemmak Abemeelekiki shiqik firi Bo'eezi ofo'leebaa dage; Bo'eezinna summik ye'eexxi «Amo ani bira ofo'li» hiyye. Isinna isi bira mare ofo'le. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Bo'eezi geedhe giddii'ni tomme geedhe fi'leexxi ofoldaashsha asse; insa'nenna ofollee wodda; <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Bo'eezi ookkone aanteti shiqammaka manjichcho «Na'oomi kunni Mo'aabike boganaa'ni higge dagge'een; Abemelek fira no'okika fichchanna gurgurto'aten; <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Tinni yaane atee uuddaxxen; tennexxee konne fichcha hassaattole tenne kaba ofoldeexxe geedhe edo gatilsi; hasa gophphaattole kinni ane'ni kuli; tenne hiyyannechchi fichchaa gatilsitota'a seeri uwweeki ati'aaten; ati gatilsa gophphaattole seeri uwwaaki ani'aaten» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Manjichchikinna «Aninni gatilsannon» hiyye. <verse eid="RUT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Bo'eezinna «Eloxxen yaane kinni Na'oominaa'n fichcha gatilsitaatole reyemakiki summi ba'abaashsha eettene aro'i reyee'na Mo'aabike boganaa'ni daggemmaxxa Ruutiinna dhaaliyyo hassissaan» hiyye.<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Manjichchikinna «Iittate kaddoole fichchi kunni dokko anxe oose'a kada gophphaammaxxee'e gatilsabo'non atinni gatilsi» hiyye.<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Ookkone baro'n Isira'eelike ardike galdummishsha hidhdhaakinna gurguraak iittanni afeexxa karra welekee uwwaak uwweexxa yookaan gurgureexxa ege'nishaatee kophe lekkate'naa'ni fulche hidhdhemmakee uwwaamman; tinninna Isira'eelike ardi'a gurgureexxanna hidhdheexxa kokeessatishshaten.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Tennexxe manjichchinna Bo'eezii «Atinni gatilsi» hiyyee kophe lekka ifixxenaa'ni fulcheexxi Bo'eezi'a uwwe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:9">Lew. 25:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Bo'eezi geedhettanna ookko ofo'leemmaka manna duuchcha, «Yooni Ebemelekixxanna oose isixxe Kelewoonixxaanna Mahiloonixxa karra duuchcha Na'oominaa'n telcho dhaaleennexxa ha'no duuchchiniingi dhugaaten; <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Iittanni ookkone reyemmake Mahiloonixxa are Mo'aabichcho Ruutii'i dhaaleennen; tinninna karra gadhi'a fuldabaashshanna summi isik ye'ema'n hedhaashsha assitaan; tenne duuchchi'a techcho ha'no dhugaaten» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:5">Lew. 25:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma geedhettinna ookko hedheemmak manni duuchchi hiyyee qici, «No'o tenne duuchchi'a dhugaaten; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti tenne dhaaldaattexxa manjichcho Isira'eelika mine mittumat hujjeexxe Raaheelishshanna Liiyashsha isee'e assowwaal. Ateenna Efiraatake bogaa'ni duroonso'o; Beetelihemi'ninna gurri atik laqemaake manjo asso'o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:31">Dada. 29:31</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti tinni ka'untichcho belto ati'a ildaaxxa oose eebbiso; mini hado atika Ti'imaari Yihuda'a ildemake Faareesike mini hadishsha assowwaal» hine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:27-30">Dada. 38:27-30</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawwitixxa Booso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Konne qicinni Bo'eezi Ruutii'i dhaale; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isee eebbisemmaxxee iikki woddi siila'wite labba belto ilde. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Ookkone olla'ixxi melaalle Na'oomii'i «Atee akkisaaka akka'o ati'a uwweeka Duuchchi Woddik Gootta galati geyoo! Konne beltonna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeli'ni gurriinke asso'o! <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Belti atikixxi beltto Ruuti lumoshsha atee eeta'neen; torbaane labbaxxi oose assitaa iimi gama saxxeexxa lumoxxa yaane ise ati'a assite'een; ta'anna kinni gammachchiisaakanna cindatto wodda atee akkisaaka labbaka belto ati'a ildeen» hite.<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Na'oominna anno tenne iseke finnishsha assitee adhdhite luu'mexxe lumoke kookkishshinni nossite.<verse eid="RUT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Olla'iinxi melaalle annotika summa Iyyobeedi hite fulchite; «Na'oomi'a labba belti ilemeen» hita'ni manjo duuchcha'n odeessite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:17">Moyanjo Daawwitika anna Isseyii'i ilaak Iyyobeediten.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Faareesinaa'ni Daawwiti qico'ni hexxeexxa horte: Faareesi Hetsiroonii'i i'le; <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hetsirooni Aaramii i'le; Aarami Aminaadaabi i'le; <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminaadaabi Ne'aasooni i'le; Ne'aasooninna Selimoonii'i ile; <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Selimooninna Bo'eezi i'le; Bo'eezi Iyyobeedii'i i'le; <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Iyyobeedi Isseyii'i i'le; Isseyyinna Daawwitii'i i'le.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>